<title>USA: Missouri direct hogs $0.50 lower - USDA.</title>
<headline>Missouri direct hogs $0.50 lower - USDA.</headline>
<dateline>JEFFERSON CITY 1997-06-16</dateline>
<text>
<p>Barrows and gilts were</p>
<p>$0.50 lower than Friday's close. Top $56.00 per cwt. - USDA</p>
<p>US 1-3   230-260 lbs    55.00-56.00</p>
<p>US 2-3   260-270 lbs    54.00-55.00</p>
<p>	   270-280 lbs    53.00-54.00</p>
<p>Sows 1.00 lower. Top 50.00.</p>
<p>US 1-3   300-500 lbs    41.00-44.00</p>
<p>	  over 500 lbs    47.00-50.00</p>
